WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
You've sat through the AI pitch—deck, buzzwords, zero impact.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.000
Meanwhile your calls go unanswered and the inbox is a mess.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
This is different.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Hi, I'm Friday.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.500
I work with the IronFeather team.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.000
We're operators who know AI—restaurants, hospitality, property management.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.500
Twenty years in the same seat you're sitting in.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.500
We build the thing we'd run in our own business.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Here's what that looks like:

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.500
AI Receptionist — fewer missed calls, more bookings, calls answered 24/7.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.000
Inbox Manager — inbox to zero, replies out on time.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Books Ready — receipts captured, reconciled, tax-ready by the 5th each month.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Friday Brief — your 8 AM brief and 8 PM wrap. Every day. What needs attention, what can wait.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Fixed price. Fixed timeline. No meter running.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.000
Wonder what this would do for your operation?

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Book a 30-minute discovery—no deck, just 12 good questions.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.500
Leave with a plan, a price, and an honest answer. If we can't help, we'll say so.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:00.000
We'll be here when you're ready.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.000
IronFeather. Heavy lifting, lightly done.
